{"t":"node","id":"diag:activation.request_template_missing","kind":"diag","class":"activation","label":"Request field (op_code/job_time) empty — no JTF request/response template under deploy/application/templates","symptom":"a Request processor throws 'op_code must not be empty or null!' (or reads null for a named field) even though the caller sends it in the standard nested {request:{<name>:{...}}} payload","role":"op_code empty op_code null job_time missing request template requestTemplate responseTemplate JTF field not mapped ExecutionContext empty deploy/application/templates marshalling dpiAccrualCalculation dpiBilling activation wiring why is op_code empty","src":"novopay-platform-accounting-v2/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/batchnew/dpi/dpiaccrualcalculation/DpiAccrualCalculationBatchProcessor.java:51","mechanism":"the infra navigation/gateway layer marshals an inbound JSON field into the ExecutionContext ONLY if it is declared in deploy/application/templates/request/product/<name>_requestTemplate.json ({field:{class:SMPL,type:String|ARR}}); a field/template absent => never placed in ExecutionContext","depends":"a <name>_requestTemplate.json + <name>_responseTemplate.json pair mirroring the closest sibling (e.g. interestAccrualCalculation_requestTemplate.json)","fails_to":"missing template => guarded field (op_code) => LOUD NovopayFatalException; unguarded field => SILENT null/default, logic quietly wrong. MIXED fail mode — not always a clean error.","diagnostic":"ls deploy/application/templates/request/product/<name>_requestTemplate.json (must exist) and grep the field in it; mirror interestAccrualCalculation_requestTemplate.json; also add the _responseTemplate.json","runbook":"claude/platform/system-activation-and-wiring.md","reference":"claude/platform/system-activation-and-wiring.md"}
