{"t":"node","id":"diag:env.dfc_rsch_tm_zero_partitions_local","kind":"diag","class":"config_resolution","label":"Local DEATH_FORECLOSURE/RSCH SUCCESS TM with 0 partitions (PREPAYMENT/BILLING OK)","symptom":"DEATH_FORECLOSURE or RSCH_DEATH_FORECLOSURE transaction_master SUCCESS but 0 transaction_details and 0 transaction_partition_details locally","role":"DEATH_FORECLOSURE RSCH_DEATH_FORECLOSURE empty partitions zero GL legs local env Out-of-scope ACCEPTANCE_STRICT force-bill BILLING LOAN_PREPAYMENT has legs","src":"scripts/dcf_sanity/group_parent_last_child_dfc_local_e2e.py:assert_gl_balanced_txn","mechanism":"Writer calls postTransaction REAL with amounts; product 44 PTC bindings exist; yet local tip systematically materializes 0 DFC/RSCH legs (44/44 sample) while LOAN_PREPAYMENT/BILLING do","depends":"product__transaction_catalogue + placeholder IAD for product 44; ExecuteTransactionRulesProcessor calculatedAmount!=0 path","fails_to":"soft Out-of-scope hid the gap; under ACCEPTANCE_STRICT harness now FAILs when TM exists with 0 partitions","diagnostic":"SELECT tc.type,COUNT(*) tm,COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM mfi_accounting.transaction_partition_details tpd WHERE tpd.transaction_id=tm.id)) with_parts FROM mfi_accounting.transaction_master tm JOIN mfi_accounting.transaction_catalogue tc ON tc.id=tm.transaction_catalogue_id WHERE tc.type IN ('DEATH_FORECLOSURE','RSCH_DEATH_FORECLOSURE','LOAN_PREPAYMENT') AND tm.id>1600000 GROUP BY tc.type;","fix":"Env/masterdata investigation for DFC posting path; harness fail-closed under ACCEPTANCE_STRICT; force-bill BILLING remains the reliable local GL proof","runbook":"cursor-bundle/brain/runbooks/sdcp-10199-group-parent-last-child-dfc.md","reference":"cursor-bundle/memory/feedback_child_cg_gl_vs_parent_named.md"}
