{"t":"node","id":"diag:ordering.by_latest_rejected_business_date","kind":"diag","class":"ordering","label":"getLoanForeclosureDetails BY_LATEST shows REJECTED when test business date > system (TDPQA-207)","symptom":"foreclosure details tab shows REJECTED row; BY_LATEST picks wrong prepayment_details; MAX(created_on)","role":"BY_LATEST REJECTED REJECT created_on business date PlatformDateUtil valueDate TDPQA-207 getLoanForeclosureDetails PrepaymentDetailsRepository findLatestByLoanAccountNos ordering","src":"trustt-platform-accounting/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/loan/prepayment/dao/PrepaymentDetailsRepository.java","mechanism":"CreatePrepaymentDetailsProcessor stamps created_on from ATTR_VALUE_DATE (= PlatformDateUtil.getValueDateInLong). In production getTransactionDateInLongForProduction returns systemDate — business==system. In server.environment=test, valueDate can use current.business.date (future) so REJECTED row can outrank older non-rejected by MAX(created_on).","depends":"PlatformDateUtil server.environment; prepayment_details.created_on + task_status; findLatestByLoanAccountNos / getIdAndLoanAccountIdByAcctNo","fails_to":"test env: future created_on on REJECTED wins BY_LATEST. prod: date-skew class does not apply; still demote REJECTED for status hygiene","diagnostic":"SELECT pd.id,pd.task_status,pd.created_on FROM mfi_accounting.prepayment_details pd JOIN mfi_accounting.account a ON a.id=pd.loan_account_id WHERE a.account_number='<LAN>' AND pd.is_deleted=false ORDER BY CASE WHEN pd.task_status IN ('REJECTED','REJECT') THEN 1 ELSE 0 END, pd.created_on DESC, pd.id DESC;","fix":"L1: ORDER BY non-REJECTED first then created_on DESC,id DESC. Do NOT add system_created_on column — prod valueDate==systemDate (PlatformDateUtil).","runbook":"cursor-bundle/memory/feedback_tdpqa207_real_api_test_mandatory.md","reference":"trustt-platform-lib/infra-masterdata/src/main/java/in/novopay/infra/masterdata/utils/PlatformDateUtil.java"}
