{"t":"node","id":"diag:rounding.shg_parent_child_interest_accrued_rupee","kind":"diag","class":"resolved","label":"SHG INT Accrued parent≠Σchildren — RESOLVED via installment-window distribute (3.4.2.4)","symptom":"pre-fix: parent window Accrued ≠ Σ ACTIVE children (mid-cycle independent HALF_UP / ±1). post-fix: after interestAccrualCalculation parent SoT distribute, window Accrued matches (posted floor may lift Σ children).","role":"SHG parent child interest accrued mismatch ₹1 rupee 1 rupee mid-cycle mid-month due-date seal month-end booking interest_accrued interestAccrualCalculation interestAccrualPosting carry_over HALF_UP round-twice SDCP-3245 TDPQA-72 Vikram GAP-080 LIVE children group loan JLG InterestGroupLoanAccrualDistributionService parent SoT SET window RESOLVED ffa882cdf","src":"trustt-platform-accounting/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/loan/grouploan/interest/service/InterestGroupLoanAccrualDistributionService.java","mechanism":"ffa882cdf on mfi_integration_v3.4.2.4: InterestGroupLoanAccrualDistributionService after parent interestAccrualCalculation (online+batch, including stop_interest_accrual) SETs each ACTIVE child's installment-window Accrued from parent window total via GroupLoanUtility.getFinalAmountListUsingCarryOver + fraction renormalize. Children skip independent calc. Posted/GL untouched; Accrued never below Posted. Removed InterestAccrualBookingService#adjustChildLoanAccountsInterestAccrual (forceful last-child pad).","depends":"interest_accrual_details; loan_due_details today-or-next due; ACTIVE children fractions; GroupLoanUtility","fails_to":"pre-fix mid-cycle drift; trains without ffa882cdf still independent child calc. Historic windows outside current installment not rewritten. Force-bill parent posting amount still out of scope.","diagnostic":"\\i scripts/sql/helpers/verify_shg_interest_accrual_parity.sql — expect PASS or PASS_POSTED_FLOOR; live: scripts/scratch/shg_int_distribute/run_prod_grade_checks.py","fix":"RESOLVED on accounting mfi_integration_v3.4.2.4 @ffa882cdf — parent SoT installment-window distribute. GAP-080 future schedule INT still product-open.","runbook":"cursor-bundle/brain/runbooks/shg-foreclosure-bpi-parent-child-parity.md","reference":".cursor/changelog.md 2026-07-30 SHG INT Accrued distribute; .cursor/gaps-and-risks.md"}
{"t":"node","id":"diag:rounding.shg_parent_member_future_int_rupee","kind":"diag","class":"null_default","label":"GAP-080 — SHG parent vs remaining member future schedule INT ₹1","symptom":"future repayment-schedule interest (INT dues after today) parent ≠ remaining member by ₹1 after child FC/DFC","role":"GAP-080 parent member future INT ₹1 schedule drift Vikram 2026-07-22 TDPQA-72 remaining member loan_due_details INT future_int_parity product decision","src":"scripts/testing/foreclosure/dcf_tdpqa72_product_pins.py:46-62","mechanism":"After one child closes, residual parent vs remaining LIVE child schedule INT can differ by ₹1 from independent rounding / RSTCRE split (product-open). Quote Vikram #390372: ₹1 difference in future schedule interest between parent and remaining member (QA4 context parent 6011375025).","depends":"loan_due_details component_type=INT is_deleted=false due_date>today; child RSCH/FC events","fails_to":"QA sees schedule INT mismatch; registry Out-of-scope until product chooses fix vs tolerance","diagnostic":"SELECT a.account_number, SUM(ldd.due_amount) FILTER (WHERE ldd.due_date>CURRENT_DATE) future_int FROM mfi_accounting.loan_due_details ldd JOIN mfi_accounting.loan_account la ON la.account_id=ldd.loan_account_id JOIN mfi_accounting.account a ON a.id=la.account_id WHERE ldd.component_type='INT' AND COALESCE(ldd.is_deleted,false)=false AND (a.account_number='<PARENT>' OR la.parent_loan_account_id=(SELECT account_id FROM mfi_accounting.loan_account x JOIN mfi_accounting.account y ON y.id=x.account_id WHERE y.account_number='<PARENT>')) GROUP BY 1;","fix":"PRODUCT: (A) fix drift so parent/member future INT match; (B) tolerance-document ₹1 with sign-off. No value assert until chosen.","runbook":"cursor-bundle/brain/flows/loan-death-foreclosure.md","reference":".cursor/gaps-and-risks.md GAP-080"}
{"t":"node","id":"diag:rounding.shg_bpi_parent_child_rupee","kind":"diag","class":"null_default","label":"SDCP-11058 — SHG parent FC BPI ≠ sum(children) from independent HALF_UP (RESOLVED)","symptom":"parent foreclosure BPI quote e.g. 79 ≠ sum child BPI 39+39=78","role":"SDCP-11058 SHG BPI parity parent child foreclosure independent HALF_UP getDistributedAmountEqually round-twice","src":"trustt-platform-accounting/src/main/java/in/novopay/accounting/loan/grouploan/foreclosure/processor/ChildLoanForeclosureProcessor.java:213-218","mechanism":"Was per-child sim bpi_amount HALF_UP; now distribute parent BPI via getDistributedAmountEqually (any N) so sum(children)==parent","depends":"childLoanBookingDTOList fractions; parent bpi_details.due_amount","fails_to":"pre-fix: round-twice drift; post-fix: sum matches parent quote","diagnostic":"\\i scripts/sql/helpers/verify_shg_foreclosure_bpi_parity.sql with parent_lan","fix":"RESOLVED on trains with SDCP-11058; ntest foreclosure.shg_bpi_parity","runbook":"cursor-bundle/brain/runbooks/shg-foreclosure-bpi-parent-child-parity.md","reference":".cursor/gaps-and-risks.md RESOLVED SDCP-11058"}
